    {
      "id": "7f3e7c8b-0c78-4c18-b570-a87f6e54f16c",
      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-01-05T05:42:00.000Z",
      "title": "Thyrocare Technologies Limited Appoints Rajdeep Panwar as Chief Commercial Officer, Effective January 5, 2026",
      "body": "Thyrocare Technologies Limited approved the appointment of Mr. Rajdeep Panwar as Chief Commercial Officer of the Company, categorised as Senior Management Personnel, with effect from January 5, 2026. Mr. Rajdeep Panwar is a senior healthcare and diagnostics industry professional with over 21 years of experience, having led large-scale diagnostic networks, laboratory operations and commercial functions across reputed healthcare organisations. He most recently served as Director – GHL Pharma & Diagnostics Limited (Medanta Labs), where he led the establishment and expansion of laboratory and pharmacy business verticals across North India. His prior experience includes leadership roles at Apollo Diagnostics, Dr. Lal PathLabs, Ortho Clinical Diagnostics (Johnson & Johnson Group), Quest Diagnost",
      "keyDevTypeId": "16",
      "source_url": null,
